---
description: Rules for changing settings (config.yaml and its loader)
globs: config.yaml, scheduler/config.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- `scheduler/config.py` validates everything and raises `ConfigError` with a message a beginner can act on.
- A new or changed setting must be updated in all of these places together (AGENTS.md rule 1):
  `scheduler/config.py` · `docs/dashboard.html` (`normalize`, `toYaml`, `validate`, UI) · `config.yaml` (with a
  short comment) · `README.md` · `tests/test_config.py`.
- `config.yaml` may be rewritten by the dashboard, which keeps only the fields it knows.
  An unsupported field would be silently dropped, so add it to the dashboard too.
- Times are `"HH:MM"` strings in quotes, 24-hour, in `timezone`. Days are `daily`, `weekdays`, or a list of `mon`…`sun`.
- After changes run `.venv/bin/python main.py list` and `.venv/bin/python -m pytest`.
